From: Codex Unleashed <codex-unleashed@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 14:23:51 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Keep history replay and subagent switches responsive

Retain bounded initial history hydration and older-page navigation. Skip
visualization permission-context construction for ordinary replayed and
completed assistant markdown and plain transcript pages. Visualization
references keep fresh permission and fragment validation; live streams
retain context for references arriving in later chunks.

Preserve the stable default-enabled unleashed_agent_fast_switching feature
and its latest-compaction window for agent switching.

